{"version":1,"content":"<p>智利競爭監管機構近日請求該國反壟斷法院對蘋果公司處以約8000萬美元罰款，理由是其涉嫌實施反競爭行為。與此同時，監管機構還要求法院責令蘋果採取糾正措施，放寬對iOS系統應用分發和應用內支付的限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588238.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.132656+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:09:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758951+00:00","content_hash":"f9ba8b59efa4d9093af5a29b5bfc7d77d074a9dbf91a4cd8ff1bda1cfeae597f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}